	"data": "Godot 4.6 XR Features\n\nGodot 4.6 (released January 26, 2026) brought major XR maturation.\nRelease: <https://godotengine.org/releases/4.6/>\nXR Update: <https://godotengine.org/article/godot-xr-update-mar-2026/>\nLicense: MIT\nStatus: Stable release\n\nWhat Shipped\nOpenXR 1.1 with automatic 1.0 fallback\nSpatial Entities — persistent anchors, plane detection, marker tracking\nFrame synthesis with depth buffer (Application SpaceWarp — ~70% more rendering headroom)\nKhronos-loader APK — one build deploys…",
